Subject: [PATCH] Move Top Stats to new internal stats endpoint (#6035)

* add new internal query endpoint

* add an API interface on FE and use it for top stats

* prevent all time from showing comparison arrows

* fixup: keep metric label the same as is

* FE: always ask for time on page and bounce rate

* BE: sometimes drop time on page

* update changelog

* remove strict comparisons and change defaults

* fixup: make FE unaware of drop_unavailable_time_on_page

* make kw list syntax less noisy

* remove console log

* hotfix: avoid duplicate IDs

* fix test
